# InkOS — Sprint 5 Design Spec: Digital Consent Forms

**From:** Vega (Design Agent)
**To:** Koda (Feature Builder)
**Date:** 2026-04-15
**Stack:** Stack A — Next.js 16.2.3, Tailwind 4, shadcn base-nova, dark-first
**Sprint:** 5 — Digital Consent Forms (Week 11–12)

---

## 0. Pre-Build Rules (carry all 40 from Sprints 1–4 forward, plus these)

41. Dato runs migration `20260415000009_consent_forms.sql` before Koda writes a single line of consent UI. Tables needed: `consent_templates`, `consent_template_versions`, `consent_form_requests`, `consent_submissions`, `consent_section_answers`, `consent_guardian_signatures`, `consent_reach_records`. All are RLS-gated by `studio_id`. Dato confirms readiness.
42. Public signing routes (`/consent/[token]`, `/consent/view/[consentToken]`) use ZERO InkOS chrome — no AppSidebar, no AppHeader, no ThemeProvider class inheritance. They use their own isolated `ConsentLayout` that injects studio branding (logo + brand_color) from the `consent_form_requests` join. The `(app)` layout wrapper NEVER wraps these routes.
43. Signature pads: library choice is **`react-signature-canvas`** (`react-signature-canvas@1.0.6`). Wrapped in a controlled `SignaturePad` component at `components/consent/SignaturePad.tsx`. It captures both a vectorized SVG data URL and a rasterized PNG data URL. Both are stored — PNG in Supabase Storage, SVG in the `answers` jsonb column.
44. Section drag-reorder in the template builder uses **`@dnd-kit/core`** + **`@dnd-kit/sortable`** (already chosen across InkOS for consistency). `SortableContext` with `verticalListSortingStrategy`. Never `react-beautiful-dnd` (deprecated).
45. Template builder two-panel layout: LEFT panel is `w-[340px] shrink-0`, RIGHT panel is `flex-1 min-w-0`. On mobile (`< lg`) RIGHT panel is hidden and replaced by a "Preview" bottom sheet trigger. LEFT panel goes full-width on mobile.
46. `template_snapshot` is a JSONB column on `consent_submissions`. It stores the full resolved template at signing time — sections, labels, version. This never changes after signing. The submission view always renders from `template_snapshot`, never re-joins to current template state.
47. Progress saved to localStorage: key pattern `inkos:consent:${token}:progress` — shape `{ answers: Record<sectionId, unknown>, completedSections: string[], savedAt: string }`. Restored on mount if token matches. Cleared on successful submission.
48. PDF generation is async — it runs in the BullMQ worker `workers/jobs/handlers/consent-pdf.ts` after submission. The submission view shows a "Generating PDF..." skeleton until `pdf_url IS NOT NULL`. Never block signing on PDF generation.
49. Retention countdown: displayed on both the template card and the submission detail. Formula: `signed_at + retention_years * 365 days`. Show as "Auto-deletes in X years, Y months" using `date-fns/formatDistanceToNow`. Red when < 6 months remaining.
50. Markdown in section bodies: render via **`react-markdown`** with `rehype-sanitize`. Never `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. Only allow: `p`, `strong`, `em`, `ul`, `ol`, `li`, `a`, `br`. No headings inside section body (they have their own `label` field).

