Mode behavior:

| Mode | Inputs | Signature pad | Shows answers |
|---|---|---|---|
| `preview` | Interactive (no save) | Rendered, strokes not saved | No |
| `signing` | Interactive + validates | Functional, captures | Live state |
| `readonly` | Disabled | Shows PNG | From `answers` prop |

