## 12. Build Sequence for Koda (14 items, linear)

### Item 1 — Database + types
**Acceptance:** `pnpm typecheck` passes. Migration applied. `supabase gen types` output has `consent_templates`, `consent_submissions`, `consent_form_requests` tables. RLS policies confirmed by Dato.

### Item 2 — Design tokens + CSS
Add Sprint 5 tokens to `app/globals.css` (Section 1 of this spec). New CSS classes: consent status dots, kind badges, sig-pad-wrapper, builder-section, signing-card, signing-page, reach-block, signed-watermark. Add new keyframes.
**Acceptance:** No Tailwind compile errors. `pnpm build` passes.

### Item 3 — `types/consent.ts`
Full typed schema for all 11 `ConsentSection` subtypes (Section 3). Export `ConsentSection` union type. Export all individual section interfaces.
**Acceptance:** `pnpm typecheck` passes. No `unknown` or `any`.

### Item 4 — `SignaturePad.tsx`
Implement `components/consent/SignaturePad.tsx` per Section 5 spec. Props: `onCapture`, `onClear`, `disabled`, `height`, `label`, `required`, `hasValue`. Implements SVG path builder. Min 3 strokes + 20 points validation. `touchAction: none`. CSS classes from Section 1.
**Acceptance:** Renders in Storybook (or local test page). Mouse draw works. Touch draw works. Clear resets. `onCapture` fires with valid PNG data URL string + SVG string after min threshold met. `hasValue` shows green border.

### Item 5 — `ConsentFormRenderer.tsx` + all 11 section components
Build `components/consent/ConsentFormRenderer.tsx` and all 11 section sub-components under `components/consent/sections/`. Three modes: `preview`, `signing`, `readonly`. `react-markdown` + `rehype-sanitize` for body rendering. `SignaturePad` in signature + initials sections.
**Acceptance:** All 11 section types render in all 3 modes without errors. Signing mode calls `onAnswer` on change. Readonly mode shows filled `answers`. No `console.log`.

### Item 6 — Template builder layout + meta bar
Build `app/(app)/consent-forms/templates/new/page.tsx`, `[id]/edit/page.tsx`. Two-panel layout with `ResizablePanelGroup` (or fixed `w-[340px]` left + `flex-1` right). `TemplateBuilderTopBar`, `TemplateMetaBar`. Mobile: right panel hidden, bottom preview sheet.
**Acceptance:** Page loads without error at `/consent-forms/templates/new`. Left panel visible. Right panel shows live preview (empty sections = placeholder text). Save button present. Mobile: preview button visible in bottom bar.

### Item 7 — Section palette + dnd-kit sortable list
Build `SectionPalette.tsx`, `TemplateSectionList.tsx`, `TemplateSectionItem.tsx`, `SectionEditForm.tsx`. `@dnd-kit/sortable` with `DragOverlay` ghost. Click palette item → append new section with `nanoid(10)` id. Active section expands inline edit form. Type-specific fields per Section 3.
**Acceptance:** Can add all 11 section types via palette. Can drag-reorder. Active section shows correct fields. Delete confirms then removes section. `animationFillMode: "both"` on section list entrance animation.

### Item 8 — Template save logic (new + edit + versioning)
Wire save button to API routes. `POST /api/consent-templates` for new. `PATCH /api/consent-templates/[id]` for metadata-only changes. `POST /api/consent-templates/[id]/versions` for section changes. Library import seeds 5 templates on click. Version bump toast.
**Acceptance:** New template saves and redirects to edit URL. Section edit creates new version. Metadata-only edit does NOT create new version. All Sonner toasts fire correctly.

### Item 9 — Consent hub page (hub + submissions tab + templates tab)
Build `app/(app)/consent-forms/page.tsx`. Submissions tab: DataTable with all columns, filter bar (template/date/client/booking), bulk export button. Templates tab: grid of `TemplateCard`. Loading skeletons. Empty states per Section 9.
**Acceptance:** Page loads. Submissions table renders with mock/real data. Filters work. Template grid renders. Archive action triggers AlertDialog. Duplicate creates copy and navigates to edit. Empty states show correctly when no data.

### Item 10 — Isolated consent layout + public signing page
Build `app/consent/layout.tsx` (no auth wrapper, studio branding CSS variable injection). Build `app/consent/[token]/page.tsx`. localStorage recovery. Progress bar (sticky, animated fill). Section-by-section render using `ConsentFormRenderer` in signing mode. Submit CTA disabled until complete. Submit POST → success state. Error state for invalid/expired token.
**Acceptance:** `/consent/test-token` loads without auth. No AppSidebar. Studio branding renders. Progress bar updates on section completion. localStorage saves on answer. Submit fires POST. Success state shows. Error state shows for 404 token.

### Item 11 — Minor/guardian consent flow
On pages where `requires_guardian = true`: render guardian name input, relationship select, second SignaturePad after client signature. Include guardian data in submit payload. Store in `consent_guardian_signatures` table.
**Acceptance:** When `requires_guardian = true` on template, guardian block renders. Submit payload includes `guardian_name`, `guardian_relationship`, `guardian_signature_png`, `guardian_signature_svg`. Submission saved correctly.

### Item 12 — Submission detail page
Build `app/(app)/consent-forms/submissions/[id]/page.tsx`. Render: breadcrumb, title, audit card (`ConsentAuditCard`), snapshot answers via `ConsentFormRenderer mode="readonly"`, signature PNG, guardian section if applicable, REACH ink batch editor, PDF download card with skeleton until `pdf_url` ready. Actions: Resend PDF, Soft delete (AlertDialog with retention warning).
