Build `app/consent/view/[consentToken]/page.tsx`. Clean printable layout. `SignedCopyWatermark` component. Download PDF CTA. Print styles correct (watermark opacity increases).
**Acceptance:** Page loads without auth. Watermark renders at correct diagonal. Download PDF button triggers signed URL download. Print: no sidebar, no header, watermark visible.

### Item 14 — Send consent modal + appointment integration + dashboard card
Add `SendConsentModal.tsx` to appointment detail page. Consent status badge on appointment rows. Dashboard pending consent card. Appointments list "Missing consent" filter. Auto-send toggle in booking_page_settings.
