Build `workers/jobs/handlers/consent-pdf.ts`. BullMQ job: receives `submissionId`, fetches submission + template_snapshot + answers + signature PNGs (via signed URLs), renders `ConsentPdfDocument`, uploads to Supabase Storage, updates `consent_submissions.pdf_url`. Enqueued immediately after submission POST.
**Acceptance:** After submission, `consent_submissions.pdf_url` is populated within 30 seconds. PDF is valid (opens in browser). Contains studio logo, template title, all sections, signature image, audit metadata, watermark. PDF size < 2 MB for typical consent form.

### Item 16 — Realtime consent status updates
Subscribe to `consent_submissions` table changes via Supabase Realtime on the consent hub page. When `status` changes to `opened` or `signed`, fire the appropriate Sonner toast (per Section 10) and update the DataTable row without full refresh.
**Acceptance:** With the hub page open, signing a form in a second tab fires a toast within 2 seconds. DataTable row status updates without page reload.

