## 14. Accessibility Checklist

- [ ] All section labels use `<label>` with `htmlFor` or `aria-labelledby`
- [ ] Signature pad: `aria-label="Signature pad"` on canvas element
- [ ] Required sections: `aria-required="true"` on inputs + red asterisk visible
- [ ] Progress bar: `role="progressbar" aria-valuenow={completed} aria-valuemax={total} aria-label="Form completion"`
- [ ] Submit button: `disabled` when incomplete (prevents accidental submit), descriptive tooltip why
- [ ] Drag handles: `aria-label="Drag to reorder section"` + keyboard: Space to pick up, arrow keys to move, Space to drop
- [ ] Color contrast: all badge text ≥ 4.5:1 against badge background
- [ ] Focus rings: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2` on all interactive elements
- [ ] Template builder keyboard: Tab through sections, Enter to expand, Escape to collapse
- [ ] Public signing page: `<main>` landmark, `<h1>` for template title, section headings in order
- [ ] Print: @media print hides interactive elements, shows only content + signature images
- [ ] Touch targets: all buttons ≥ 44×44px on mobile signing page

